{"id":"gamefreak-lineblog-2834736","kind":"blog","type":"Game Freak 博客","card":"blog","title":"【日记】2016横滨中华街与北京烤鸭","display_title":null,"dek":null,"excerpt":"增田顺一回忆童年逛横滨中华街时，被带着脸的北京烤鸭吓到，如今仍对它印象深刻。","date":"2016-04-16","publication":"増田順一 公式ブログ · 中華街","source":{"title":"増田順一 公式ブログ · 中華街","url":"https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/2834736.html","archive_url":"https://web.archive.org/web/20160420232834id_/https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/2834736.html","type":"official_blog_wayback"},"issue":null,"interviewee":[],"people":[{"name":"增田顺一","slug":"masuda-junichi"}],"mentions":[],"works":[],"tags":["Game Freak","增田顺一","LINE BLOG","食べもの飲みもの"],"categories":["官方博客","Game Freak","数字存档"],"topics":[],"era":null,"url":"https://docs.pokeamice.com/gamefreak-director/lineblog-2834736/","body_kind":"markdown","segment_count":null,"pages":0,"proof":null,"cover":"https://docs.pokeamice.com/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2834736/001-7a69c1f201.webp","cover_kind":"own","size":[1136,852],"archive_type":"gamefreak_masuda_lineblog","summary":"增田顺一回忆童年逛横滨中华街时，被带着脸的北京烤鸭吓到，如今仍对它印象深刻。","interviewer":null,"translator":null,"original_lang":null,"translation_status":"openai-machine-translated","body":{"kind":"markdown","markdown_zh":"<br>\n既然难得来一次\n午餐就去\n横滨中华街吧！\n<br>\n<br>\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2834736/001-7a69c1f201.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2834736/001-7a69c1f201.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n<br>\n比以前多了好多自助餐……\n真让人难过……\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n啊！\n对了对了！\n<br>\n小时候\n有人带我来中华街，\n让我觉得害怕的是……\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n就是这个！\n<br>\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2834736/002-879e6a7049.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2834736/002-879e6a7049.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n长着脸的北京烤鸭！！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n（因为害怕，所以没靠近就拍了下来（笑））\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n哇！\n好可怜！！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n小时候的我\n就这么想（笑）\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n所以增田对中华街的印象\n直到现在\n仍然是北京烤鸭（笑）\n\n<br>","markdown_ja":"<br>\nせっかくなので\nランチは\n横浜中華街へ！\n<br>\n<br>\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2834736/001-7a69c1f201.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2834736/001-7a69c1f201.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n<br>\n昔より食べ放題増えた・・・\n悲しい・・・\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\nあ！\nそうそう！\n<br>\n子供だったころ\n中華街に連れてきてもらって\n怖かったのが・・・\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\nこちら！\n<br>\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2834736/002-879e6a7049.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2834736/002-879e6a7049.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n顔付きの北京ダック！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n（怖いから寄らずに撮ったw）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nうわ！\n可哀想！！って\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n子供ながらに\n思った（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nなのでマスダの中華街の印象は\nいまでも\n北京ダックなのです（笑）\n\n<br>"}}